# Spec Kit records a sha256 for every vendor-managed file under this directory
# in integrations/*.manifest.json, computed over the LF bytes written at install
# time. With core.autocrlf=true a checkout would rewrite them as CRLF, so every
# hash would mismatch and `specify integration status` would report all of them
# as modified. Pin them to LF so the integrity record survives a clone on any
# machine.
* text=auto eol=lf
